  "observation_rules": [
    "GRWM and occasion GRWM can overlap as genres and must not be added into a deduplicated unique audience.",
    "2023 partial-year GRWM, 2024 calendar prom/GRWM and 2025 beginner sewing are different dates and title/content filters, not a coherent trend series.",
    "Counts are YouTube video view events, not unique viewers, active creators, people of a specific gender, buyers or creator earnings.",
    "No category exclusively defines women or girls; content interest is not validated demographic identity.",
